# ---- SoftTrans (https://mio.pantsu.uk) ---------------------------------------
# Kept at the top of [Rule] by shadowrocket/build.sh, so updates never drop it.
# Signaling (WSS) matches by domain. STUN and TURN are raw UDP/TCP to the server's
# IP with no hostname attached, so the IP has to be matched too; otherwise they
# fall through to FINAL,PROXY and the relay detours through the proxy.
DOMAIN,mio.pantsu.uk,DIRECT
IP-CIDR,45.89.232.91/32,DIRECT,no-resolve
# Device-to-device traffic on the home network. bypass-tun in [General] already
# keeps these ranges (and 224.0.0.0/4, which mDNS .local lookups use) out of the
# tunnel; these lines are a backstop for traffic that reaches the rules anyway.
IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,DIRECT,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,169.254.0.0/16,DIRECT,no-resolve
# ---- end SoftTrans --------------------------------------------------------------
